            "review_title": "Review at Breakfast Co",
            "review_text": "Scenic62249140041\n1 contribution\n0\nGood food, good mood\nMay 2025 • Couples\nXiao Long Bao fried with eggs was really good, others things were around 8/10. The shop has the American fast food store - but selling Chinese food vibe. Impressive music taste, felt like 2010 - 2016 prime time. Owner and others staffs were very welcoming us. Not really a dimsum fan but I will definitely come back to this place!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten June 13, 2025",
